---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Wearlivo | Online Stopwatch"
  description="Online Stopwatch is a free browser stopwatch for everyday focus, practice, and lap timing. Learn how it works and what it saves."
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap prose-page">
    <span class="eyebrow">PURPOSEFULLY SIMPLE</span>
    <h1>A little space for your time.</h1>
    <p>
      Wearlivo creates simple tools for a better daily rhythm. Online Stopwatch
      is our free online stopwatch at wearlivo.com, with a clear clock, useful
      lap records, and room to focus on the task in front of you.
    </p>
    <h2>Made for everyday moments</h2>
    <p>
      Time a practice session, compare repeated tasks, or see how long your next
      piece of work takes. Start, pause, and record laps without creating an
      account. Export your results when you are done.
    </p>
    <h2>A tool that stays out of your way</h2>
    <p>
      The stopwatch runs in your browser. Your session is saved on your device
      so you can choose to restore it after a refresh. There are no advertising
      scripts or third-party analytics in this version.
    </p>
    <h2>Clear about its limits</h2>
    <p>
      Display precision is not a guarantee of measurement accuracy. Browser
      scheduling, device sleep, and human input can affect timing. Recovery of a
      running session relies on your device clock. This tool is intended for
      everyday use, not certified sporting or scientific measurements.
    </p>
    <p>
      Read the <a href="/#questions">frequently asked questions</a> or learn
      about <a href="/privacy/">local data storage</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/">Open your stopwatch →</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
